  "details": "~~I'm not sure how much of this was intentional and how much was a teaser; while this is fine as a pre-release joke, if this goes to live as-is it would be quite disruptive. In particular, this is a station which you can't leave without respawning, which can't be dismissed, is invisible, and where the instance owner can't identify who spawned it. And, as far as I can see even the spawner can't dismiss it?~~\n\nEdit: Hmm. I'm not sure if this is actually related to the reference cube. Will reopen as a separate issue with more detail.",
